<title>INDIA: India soyoil prices mixed in sluggish trade.</title>
<headline>India soyoil prices mixed in sluggish trade.</headline>
<dateline>INDORE, India 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soyoil solvent and refined prices closed mixed while soybean was steady in sluggish trade on Friday, traders said.</p>
<p>Soyoil solvent rose 100 rupees per tonne while its refined variety lost a similar amount.</p>
<p>Soymeal prices improved on better export demand against tight supply. Soymeal yellow was quoted at $298 per tonne for export while rapeseed extraction fetched $117. It was quoted at 3,950 rupees per tonne Free on Rail condition.</p>
